        "quote": "In determining boundaries of zoning districts as shown on the district map, the following rules shall apply:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.50.060:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.50.060 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "94c90113-797e-5c48-8c4a-d9f541d045ef",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 277,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.50.060:block:1",
          "start": 109
        },
        "quote": "(a) The district boundaries are the City limits or the centerlines of rights-of-way including: streets, alleys, railways, creeks, streams, rivers, or drainage channels.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.50.060:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.50.060 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "914c57dd-1f18-5ebb-a155-6c77daf1248d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 676,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.50.060:block:2",
          "start": 278
        },
        "quote": "(b) Where the district boundaries are not otherwise indicated and where the property has been or may hereafter be divided into blocks and lots, the district boundaries shall be construed to be the lot lines, and where the districts are bounded approximately by lot lines, the lot lines shall be construed to be the boundary of the districts unless the boundaries are otherwise indicated on the map.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.50.060:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.50.060 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "0c96d420-abf8-5e57-9e2d-e33704b62987",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 847,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.50.060:block:3",
          "start": 677
        },
        "quote": "(c) In properties that are not subdivided, the district boundary lines on the map shall be determined by use of the scale appearing on the map. (Ord. 19569 § 1, 5-24-11.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.50.060:block:3#text",
